# Literal Windows paths accidentally created as repo-root filenames when a script
# with a hardcoded MAPPALACHIA_DB / MAPPALACHIA_DIR default is run outside Windows
# (Linux/CI/WSL treats "D:\..." as an ordinary filename). Never a real deliverable.
/[A-Za-z]:\\*

